<div id="pf12" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="12"><div class="pc pc12 w0 h0"><img class="bi x0 y1da w1 h29" alt="" src="bg12.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">5<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>网络层</span></div><div class="t m0 xb h12 y11 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff6">5<span class="_ _19"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff9 fc7"><span class="_ _19"> </span></span>网络层</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y65 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">5.1<span class="_ _24"> </span>IP</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1db ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.1.1<span class="_ _32"> </span>IP<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff1">地址基本概念</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1dc ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _4"></span><span class="ff3">IP <span class="ff4">地址是给连接在因特网上的每台主机<span class="_ _4"></span>（或路由器）<span class="_ _3"></span>分配的一个在全世界范围内<span class="ff1">唯一</span>的<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">32<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位<span class="_ _4"></span>（<span class="ff3">bit</span>）</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1dd ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">标识符。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1de ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">本质<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">IP </span>地址不仅仅指代一台<span class="_ _f"></span>设备，它实际上表示的是</span>主机<span class="_ _f"></span>到网络的一个连接<span class="ff4">（接口）<span class="_ _4d"></span>。如果一台主机<span class="_ _f"></span>有</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1df ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">两个网卡连接到两个不同的网络，它就必须拥有两个<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1e0 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">管理机构<span class="ff4">：由<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff6">ICANN <span class="ff3">(Internet Corporation f<span class="_ _3"></span>or Assigned N<span class="_ _3"></span>ames and N<span class="_ _29"></span>umbers<span class="ff4">，<span class="_ _f"></span>互联网名字与号码<span class="_ _f"></span>指派公司</span>)</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1e1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">进行分配。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1e2 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.1.2<span class="_ _32"> </span>IP<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff1">地址的结构</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y1e3 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">地址采用<span class="ff1">分层</span>的地址结构，由两部分组成：</span></div><div class="t m0 x7f h7 y1e4 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">地址<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffa">{<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff8">&lt;<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span></span>网络号<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(NetID) <span class="ff8">&gt;,<span class="_ _e"> </span>&lt;<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff4">主机号<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>(HostID) <span class="ff8">&gt;<span class="ffa">}</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1e5 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">网络号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Net-ID)<span class="ff4">：标志主机（或路由器）所连接到的网络。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1e6 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">主机号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Host-ID)<span class="ff4">：标志该主机（或路由器）在网络中的唯一身份。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1e7 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.1.3<span class="_ _32"> </span>IP<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff1">地址的分类<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Classful A<span class="_ _29"></span>ddressing)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1e8 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">根据网络号和主机号位数的不同，<span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址分为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">A</span>、<span class="ff3">B</span>、<span class="ff3">C</span>、<span class="ff3">D</span>、<span class="ff3">E<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>五类。</div><div class="t m0 x74 h6 y1e9 ff1 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">表<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">5.1:<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">地址分类表</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x80 h6 y1ea ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">类别<span class="_ _3a"> </span>首位标识<span class="_ _3a"> </span>网络号范围<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(</span>十进制<span class="ff6">)<span class="_ _3a"> </span></span>适用场景</div><div class="t m0 x80 h6 y1eb ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">A<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">类<span class="_ _4e"> </span><span class="ff10">0...<span class="_ _4e"> </span></span></span>1<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">∼<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>126<span class="_ _4f"> </span><span class="ff4">超大型网络</span></div><div class="t m0 x80 h6 y1ec ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">B<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">类<span class="_ _50"> </span><span class="ff10">10...<span class="_ _51"> </span></span></span>128<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">∼<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>191<span class="_ _52"> </span><span class="ff4">中型网络</span></div><div class="t m0 x80 h6 y1ed ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">C<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">类<span class="_ _1a"> </span><span class="ff10">110...<span class="_ _1a"> </span></span></span>192 <span class="ffa">∼<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>223<span class="_ _52"> </span><span class="ff4">小型局域网</span></div><div class="t m0 x80 h6 y1ee ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">D<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">类<span class="_ _53"> </span><span class="ff10">1110...<span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">224 <span class="ffa">∼<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>239<span class="_ _52"> </span></span></span>多播<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(<span class="ff1">组播</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x80 h6 y1ef ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">E<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">类<sp